## Medals shaped around the celebration

Carnival medals carry parade themes, club identity and local traditions in a colorful, collectible format. Crowns, masks, mascots, city symbols and anniversary dates can be combined with custom outlines, cutouts and dimensional detail for Mardi Gras krewes, festivals and community events.

## Coordinate relief, color and neckwear

Choose crisp 2D artwork, sculpted 3D elements or a combination of both. Bright or antique plating can be paired with enamel, glitter, translucent color, printed detail or a metal-only treatment. Compose the medal with its ribbon, lanyard, bead chain or cord so the complete piece works when worn or presented.

## From event artwork to finished medal

The artwork defines lettering, relief, color areas, cutouts and attachment points before tooling. Die striking suits clear raised and recessed details; zinc-alloy casting accommodates more complex outlines and deeper forms. After finishing, the selected attachment is assembled and the medal is checked for detail, color and secure connections.

## Plan your edition

Medals are available in 2-4 inch formats, with custom sizes also possible. The minimum order is 50 pieces and typical production is 12-18 business days, excluding shipping. Send the event theme, logo, date, intended quantity and delivery destination. For royalty, sponsors or limited editions, coordinate the metal finish, neckwear and presentation box with the occasion.
